OL,3,GNEWSADartford tunnel reopens after
OL,4,Acrane causes delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Dartford Crossing between Kent and
OL,7,FEssex has reopened after a broken-down
OL,8,Fcrane leaked oil, causing severe
OL,9,Fdelays, according to National Highways.
OL,11,FThe government agency said the west
OL,12,F(left) bore of the tunnel had been
OL,13,Fclosed as teams worked to remove the
OL,14,Fstranded 50-tonne vehicle on Thursday
OL,15,Fevening.
OL,17,FNational Highways said shortly after
OL,18,F21:00 BST that the spillage had been
OL,19,Ftreated, and a planned roadworks
OL,20,Fclosure had been pushed back to 23:00.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
