OL,3,GNEWSADartford tunnel reopens after
OL,4,Acrane causes delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorists had faced two-hours delays,
OL,7,Fwith residual delays of 30 mins and two
OL,8,Fmiles of congestion remaining on the
OL,9,Fapproach by about 22:00, a National
OL,10,FHighways spokesperson said.
